    "body": "After deleting the topic, the files remain on the server. If the topic has an image or file, it should also be deleted along with the topic (with the publication)\r\n\r\nFiles and images in the Upload folder on the server are not sorted by months or by date, in the future there will be a limit overflow ...\r\n\r\nAlso, the user cannot delete its own files from the server!\r\nIf the user or administrator deleted the publication from the forum irretrievably, then why store not used files on the server after removing the topic or publication?\r\n\r\nWhere is the logic ?",
